TE: Tolkāppiyam -- eḻuttatikāram
((ciṟappuppāyiram))
 
## 	{SA TE0i} 	{SC TE0n} 	 
1.	vaṭa vēṅkaṭam^ teṉ kumari 
2.	~āy iṭai+ 
3.	tamiḻ kūṟu nal= ulakattu 
4.	vaḻakku* um^ ceyyuḷ um āy iru mutaliṉ 
5.	eḻuttu* um^ col= um poruḷ um* nāṭi+ 
6.	cem^ tamiḻ iyaṟkai civaṇiya nilattoṭu 
7.	muntu-nūl kaṇṭu muṟaippaṭa ~eṇṇi+ 
8.	pulam^ tokuttōṉ ē pōkku* aṟu paṉuval* 
9.	^nilam^ taru tiruviṉ+ pāṇṭiyaṉ avaiyattu 
10.	aṟaṅ karai nāvil* ^nāṉ maṟai muṟṟiya 
11.	~ataṅkōṭṭu* ācāṟku* aril* ^tapa+ terintu 
12.	mayaṅkā marapiṉ eḻuttu muṟai kāṭṭi 
13.	malku nīr varaippiṉ aintiram* niṟainta 
14.	tolkāppiyaṉ eṉa+ taṉ peyar tōṟṟi+ 
15.	pal pukaḻ niṟutta paṭimaiyōṉ ē. 

((1. nūṉmarapu))
 
## 	{SA TE1i} 	{SC TE1n} 	 
1.	eḻuttu* eṉa-+paṭupa 
2.	akara mutal* 
3.	ṉakara ~iṟuvāy muppaḵtu* eṉpa 
4.	cārntu varal% marapiṉ mūṉṟu* alam^ kaṭai ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE2i} 	{SC TE2n} 	 
1.	avai tām^ 
2.	kuṟṟu* iyal ikaram^ kuṟṟu* iyal ukaram 
3.	āytam eṉṟa 
4.	mu+ pāl+ puḷḷi ~um eḻuttu* ōr-aṉṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TE3i} 	{SC TE3n} 	 
1.	avaṟṟu* -uḷ, a i u 
2.	e o eṉṉum a+pāl aintu* -um 
3.	ōr aḷapu icaikkum^ kuṟṟu* eḻuttu eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TE4i} 	{SC TE4n} 	 
1.	ā ī ū ē ai 
2.	ō au eṉṉum a+pāl ēḻu* um 
3.	īr aḷapu* icaikkum* neṭṭu* eḻuttu eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TE5i} 	{SC TE5n} 	 
1.	mū ~aḷapu* icaittal ōr eḻuttu* iṉṟu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE6i} 	{SC TE6n} 	 
1.	nīṭṭam vēṇṭiṉ av= aḷapu* uṭaiya 
2.	kūṭṭi ~eḻūutal eṉmaṉār pulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TE7i} 	{SC TE7n} 	 
1.	kaṇṇimai noṭi ~eṉa ~av= ē māttirai 
2.	nuṇṇitiṉ uṇarntōr kaṇṭa ~āṟu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE8i} 	{SC TE8n} 	 
1.	aukāram* ~iṟuvāy+ 
2.	paṉṉīr eḻuttu* um uyir eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TE9i} 	{SC TE9n} 	 
1.	ṉakāra ~iṟuvāy+, 
2.	patiṉeṇ= eḻuttu mey= eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TE10i} 	{SC TE10n} 	 
1.	meyyōṭu* iyaiyiṉum uyir iyal* ^tiriyā. 

 
## 	{SA TE11i} 	{SC TE11n} 	 
1.	meyyiṉ aḷavu* ē ~arai ~eṉa moḻipa. 

 
## 	{SA TE12i} 	{SC TE12n} 	 
1.	av= iyal* ^nilaiyum ēṉai mūṉṟu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE13i} 	{SC TE13n} 	 
1.	arai ~aḷavu kuṟukal% makaram uṭaittu* ē 
2.	y-icai ~iṭaṉ arukum^ teriyum^ kālai. 

 
## 	{SA TE14i} 	{SC TE14n} 	 
1.	uṭpeṟu puḷḷi ~uruvu* ākum= ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE15i} 	{SC TE15n} 	 
1.	meyyiṉ iyaṟkai puḷḷiyoṭu nilaiyal. 

 
## 	{SA TE16i} 	{SC TE16n} 	 
1.	ekara okarattu iyaṟkai ~um aṟṟu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE17i} 	{SC TE17n} 	 
1.	puḷḷi ~illā ~ellā mey= um 
2.	uruvu* uruvu* āki ~akaramōṭu* uyirttal um 
3.	ēṉai ~uyirōṭu* uruvu tirintu* uyirttal um 
4.	āy īr iyala ~uyirttal āṟu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE18i} 	{SC TE18n} 	 
1.	meyyiṉ vaḻiyatu* uyir tōṉṟum* nilai ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE19i} 	{SC TE19n} 	 
1.	valleḻuttu eṉpa ka ca ṭa ta pa ṟa. 

 
## 	{SA TE20i} 	{SC TE20n} 	 
1.	melleḻuttu eṉpa ṅa ña ṇa na ma ṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TE21i} 	{SC TE21n} 	 
1.	iṭaiyeḻuttu eṉpa ya ra la va ḻa ḷa. 

 
## 	{SA TE22i} 	{SC TE22n} 	 
1.	a+ mū ~āṟu* um vaḻaṅku* iyal% maruṅkiṉ 
2.	mey+mayaṅku* uṭaṉilai teriyum^ kālai. 

 
## 	{SA TE23i} 	{SC TE23n} 	 
1.	ṭa ṟa la ḷa ~eṉṉum puḷḷi muṉṉar+ 
2.	ka ca pa ~eṉṉum* mū ~eḻuttu uriya. 

 
## 	{SA TE24i} 	{SC TE24n} 	 
1.	avaṟṟuḷ 
2.	laḷaḵkāṉ muṉṉar ya va ~um^ tōṉṟum. 

 
## 	{SA TE25i} 	{SC TE25n} 	 
1.	ṅa ña ṇa na ma ṉa ~eṉum puḷḷi muṉṉar+ 
2.	tattam* micaikaḷ ottaṉa nilaiyē. 

 
## 	{SA TE26i} 	{SC TE26n} 	 
1.	avaṟṟuḷ, ṇaṉaḵkāṉ muṉṉar+ 
2.	ka ca ña pa ma ya vav= ēḻ um uriya 

 
## 	{SA TE27i} 	{SC TE27n} 	 
1.	ña na ma va ~eṉṉum puḷḷi muṉṉar 
2.	yaḵkāṉ* niṟṟaṉ meypeṟṟaṉṟu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE28i} 	{SC TE28n} 	 
1.	maḵkāṉ puḷḷi muṉ vav= um^ tōṉṟum. 

 
## 	{SA TE29i} 	{SC TE29n} 	 
1.	yaraḻa ~eṉṉum puḷḷi muṉṉar 
2.	mutalāku* eḻuttu ṅakaramoṭu tōṉṟum. 

 
## 	{SA TE30i} 	{SC TE30n} 	 
1.	meynnilai cuṭṭiṉ ellā ~eḻuttu* um^ 
2.	tam muṉ+ ^tām varūum ra ḻa ~alam^ kaṭai ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE31i} 	{SC TE31n} 	 
1.	a i u a+ mūṉṟu* um^ cuṭṭu. 

 
## 	{SA TE32i} 	{SC TE32n} 	 
1.	ā ē ō a+ mūṉṟu* um viṉā. 

 
## 	{SA TE33i} 	{SC TE33n} 	 
1.	aḷapu* iṟantu* uyirttal um oṟṟu* icai nīṭal um 
2.	uḷa ~eṉa moḻipa ~icaiyoṭu civaṇiya 
3.	narampiṉ maṟaiya ~eṉmaṉār pulavar. 

((2. moḻimarapu))
 
## 	{SA TE34i} 	{SC TE34n} 	 
1.	kuṟṟiyal ikara niṟṟal vēṇṭum 
2.	yā-v-eṉ ciṉai micai ~uraiyacai+ kiḷavikku 
3.	āvayiṉ varūu makaram ūrntu ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE35i} 	{SC TE35n} 	 
1.	puṇariyal* ^nilaiyiṭai+ kuṟukal um urittu* ē 
2.	~uṇara+ kūṟiṉ muṉṉar+ tōṉṟum. 

 
## 	{SA TE36i} 	{SC TE36n} 	 
1.	neṭṭeḻuttu impar um^ toṭarmoḻi ~īṟṟu* um^ 
2.	kuṟṟiyal ukaram vallāṟu* ūrntē. 

 
## 	{SA TE37i} 	{SC TE37n} 	 
1.	iṭaippaṭiṉ+ kuṟukum iṭaṉumār uṇṭu* ē 
2.	kaṭappāṭu* aṟinta puṇariyalāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TE38i} 	{SC TE38n} 	 
1.	kuṟiyataṉ muṉṉar āyta+ puḷḷi 
2.	~uyiroṭu puṇarnta val= āṟaṉ micaittu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE39i} 	{SC TE39n} 	 
1.	īṟu* iyaṉ maruṅkiṉ um icaimai tōṉṟum. 

 
## 	{SA TE40i} 	{SC TE40n} 	 
1.	uruviṉ um icaiyiṉ um aruki+ tōṉṟu 
2.	moḻikkuṟippu ellām eḻuttiṉ iyalā 
3.	v-āytam aḵkā+ kālaiyāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TE41i} 	{SC TE41n} 	 
1.	kuṉṟicai moḻi vayiṉ* ^niṉṟu* icai niṟaikkum* 
2.	neṭṭu* eḻuttu* impar otta kuṟṟu* eḻuttu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE42i} 	{SC TE42n} 	 
1.	ai au ~eṉṉum āy īr eḻuttiṟku* 
2.	ikara ~ukaram icainiṟaivu* ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TE43i} 	{SC TE43n} 	 
1.	neṭṭeḻuttu ēḻu* ē ~oreḻuttu orumoḻi. 

 
## 	{SA TE44i} 	{SC TE44n} 	 
1.	kuṟṟeḻuttu aintu* um* moḻiniṟaipu* ila ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE45i} 	{SC TE45n} 	 
1.	ōr eḻuttu oru moḻi ~īr eḻuttu oru moḻi 
2.	y-iraṇṭu* iṟantu* icaikkum^ toṭarmoḻi ~uḷa+paṭa 
3.	mūṉṟu* ē moḻi-nilai tōṉṟiya neṟi ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE46i} 	{SC TE46n} 	 
1.	meyyiṉ iyakkam* makaramoṭu civaṇum. 

 
## 	{SA TE47i} 	{SC TE47n} 	 
1.	tam= iyal kiḷappiṉ ellā ~eḻuttu* um* 
2.	meynnilai mayakkam* māṉam illai. 

 
## 	{SA TE48i} 	{SC TE48n} 	 
1.	yaraḻa ~eṉṉu mūṉṟu* um oṟṟa+ 
2.	kacatapa ṅañanama ~īr oṟṟu* ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TE49i} 	{SC TE49n} 	 
1.	avaṟṟuḷ, rakāra ḻakāram^ kuṟṟu* oṟṟu* ākā. 

 
## 	{SA TE50i} 	{SC TE50n} 	 
1.	kuṟumai ~um* neṭumai ~um aḷaviṉ+ kōṭaliṉ+ 
2.	^toṭarmoḻi ~ellā neṭṭeḻuttu* iyala. 

 
## 	{SA TE51i} 	{SC TE51n} 	 
1.	ceyyuḷ iṟuti+ pōli moḻi vayiṉ* 
2.	^nakāram* makāram īr oṟṟu* ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TE52i} 	{SC TE52n} 	 
1.	ṉakārai muṉṉar makāram^ kuṟukum. 

 
## 	{SA TE53i} 	{SC TE53n} 	 
1.	moḻippaṭuttu icaippiṉum^ terintuvēṟu* icaippiṉum 
2.	eḻuttiyal* ^tiriyā ~eṉmaṉār pulavar. 

 
## 	{SA TE54i} 	{SC TE54n} 	 
1.	akara ikaram aikāram ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TE55i} 	{SC TE55n} 	 
1.	akara ukaram aukāram ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TE56i} 	{SC TE56n} 	 
1.	akarattu impar yakara+ puḷḷi ~um 
2.	ai eṉ* ^neṭuñciṉai meypeṟa+ tōṉṟum. 

 
## 	{SA TE57i} 	{SC TE57n} 	 
1.	ōr aḷapu* ākum iṭaṉumār uṇṭu* ē 
2.	tērum^ kālai moḻi vayiṉāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TE58i} 	{SC TE58n} 	 
1.	ikara yakaram iṟuti viravum. 

 
## 	{SA TE59i} 	{SC TE59n} 	 
1.	paṉṉīr uyir um* moḻi mutal ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TE60i} 	{SC TE60n} 	 
1.	uyirmey ~allaṉa moḻi mutal ākā. 

 
## 	{SA TE61i} 	{SC TE61n} 	 
1.	ka ta na pa ma ~eṉum ā ~aintu* eḻuttu* um 
2.	ellā ~uyiroṭu* um^ cellumār mutal ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE62i} 	{SC TE62n} 	 
1.	cakara+ kiḷavi ~um avaṟṟu* ōr aṟṟu* ē 
2.	a ai au ~eṉu mūṉṟu* alam^ kaṭai ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE63i} 	{SC TE63n} 	 
1.	u ū o ō ~eṉṉum* nāṉku* uyir 
2.	va eṉ= eḻuttoṭu varutal illai. 

 
## 	{SA TE64i} 	{SC TE64n} 	 
1.	ā e o eṉum* mū ~uyir ñakārattu uriya. 

 
## 	{SA TE65i} 	{SC TE65n} 	 
1.	āvōṭu* allatu yakara mutalātu. 

 
## 	{SA TE66i} 	{SC TE66n} 	 
1.	mutalā ~ēṉa tam peyar mutalum. 

 
## 	{SA TE67i} 	{SC TE67n} 	 
1.	kuṟṟiyal ukara muṟaippeyar maruṅkiṉ 
2.	oṟṟiya nakaram* micai nakaramoṭu mutalum. 

 
## 	{SA TE68i} 	{SC TE68n} 	 
1.	muṟṟiyal ukaramoṭu poruḷ vēṟupaṭāatu* 
2.	a+ peyar maruṅkiṉ* ^nilaiyiyalāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TE69i} 	{SC TE69n} 	 
1.	uyir au ~eñciya ~iṟuti ~ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TE70i} 	{SC TE70n} 	 
1.	kavavōṭu* iyaiyiṉ au ~um ākum. 

 
## 	{SA TE71i} 	{SC TE71n} 	 
1.	e eṉa varum uyir mey= īṟu* ākātu. 

 
## 	{SA TE72i} 	{SC TE72n} 	 
1.	ov= um aṟṟu ē nav= alam^ kaṭai ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE73i} 	{SC TE73n} 	 
1.	ē ō eṉum uyir ñakārattu illai. 

 
## 	{SA TE74i} 	{SC TE74n} 	 
1.	u ū kāra navavoṭu navilā. 

 
## 	{SA TE75i} 	{SC TE75n} 	 
1.	uccakāram iru moḻikku urittu* ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE76i} 	{SC TE76n} 	 
1.	uppakāram oṉṟu* eṉa moḻipa 
2.	~iruvayiṉ* ^nilaiyum poruṭṭu* ākum= ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE77i} 	{SC TE77n} 	 
1.	eñciya ~ellām eñcutal ila ~ē. 

 
## 	{SA TE78i} 	{SC TE78n} 	 
1.	ñaṇanama ṉayarala vaḻaḷa ~eṉṉum 
2.	a+ patiṉoṉṟu* ē puḷḷi ~iṟuti. 

 
## 	{SA TE79i} 	{SC TE79n} 	 
1.	uccakāramoṭu nakāram^ civaṇum 

 
## 	{SA TE80i} 	{SC TE80n} 	 
1.	uppakāramoṭu ñakārai ~um aṟṟu* ē 
2.	~a+ poruḷ iraṭṭātu* ivaṇaiyāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TE81i} 	{SC TE81n} 	 
1.	vakara+ kiḷavi nāṉ moḻi ~īṟṟatu. 

 
## 	{SA TE82i} 	{SC TE82n} 	 
1.	makara+ toṭarmoḻi mayaṅkutal varainta 
2.	ṉakara+ toṭarmoḻi ~oṉpaḵtu* eṉpa 
3.	pukar aṟa+ kiḷanta ~aḵṟiṇai mēṉa. 

((3. piṟappiyal))
 
## 	{SA TE83i} 	{SC TE83n} 	 
1.	unti mutalā muntu vaḷi tōṉṟi+ 
2.	talaiyiṉ um* miṭaṟṟiṉ um* neñciṉ um* nilaii+ 
3.	pal= um itaḻ um* nā um* mūkku* um 
4.	aṇṇam um uḷappaṭa ~eṇmuṟai nilai āy 
5.	ellā ~eḻuttu* um^ collum^ kālai 
6.	piṟappiṉ ākkam vēṟuvēṟu* iyala 
7.	tiṟappaṭa+ teriyum^ kāṭciyāṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TE84i} 	{SC TE84n} 	 
1.	av vaḻi 
2.	paṉṉīr uyir um^ tam^ nilai tiriyā 
3.	miṭaṟṟu+ piṟanta vaḷiyiṉ icaikkum. 

 
## 	{SA TE85i} 	{SC TE85n} 	 
1.	avaṟṟuḷ 
2.	a ā āy iraṇṭu* aṅkāntu* iyalum. 

 
## 	{SA TE86i} 	{SC TE86n} 	 
1.	i ī e ē ai ~eṉa ~icaikkum 
2.	a+ pāl aintu* um avaṟṟu* ōr aṉṉa 
3.	~avai tām 
4.	aṇpal% mutaṉā viḷimpuṟal uṭaiya. 

 
## 	{SA TE87i} 	{SC TE87n} 	 
1.	u ū o ō au ~eṉa ~icaikkum 
2.	a+ pāl aintu* um itaḻ kuvintu* iyalum. 

 
## 	{SA TE88i} 	{SC TE88n} 	 
1.	tattam^ tiripu* ē ciṟiya ~eṉpa. 

 
## 	{SA TE89i} 	{SC TE89n} 	 
1.	kakāra ṅakāra mutaṉā ~aṇṇam. 

 
## 	{SA TE90i} 	{SC TE90n} 	 
1.	cakāra ñakāram iṭainā ~aṇṇam. 

 
## 	{SA TE91i} 	{SC TE91n} 	 
1.	ṭakāra ṇakāra nuṉinā ~aṇṇam. 

 
## 	{SA TE92i} 	{SC TE92n} 	 
1.	av= āṟu* eḻuttu* um* mū vakai+ piṟappiṉa. 

 
## 	{SA TE93i} 	{SC TE93n} 	 
1.	aṇṇa naṇṇiya paṉmutaṉ maruṅkiṉ* 
2.	^nā nuṉi parantu meyyuṟa ~oṟṟa+ 
3.	tāmatu piṟakkum^ takāra nakāram. 

 
## 	{SA TE94i} 	{SC TE94n} 	 
1.	aṇari nuṉinā ~aṇṇam oṟṟa 
2.	ṟaḵkā ṉaḵkāṉ āy iraṇṭu* um piṟakkum. 

 
## 	{SA TE95i} 	{SC TE95n} 	 
1.	nuṉinā vaṇari ~aṇṇam varuṭa 
2.	rakāra ḻakāram āy iraṇṭu* um piṟakkum. 

 
## 	{SA TE96i} 	{SC TE96n} 	 
1.	nāviḷimpu vīṅki ~aṇpaṉ mutal uṟa 
2.	~ā vayiṉ aṇṇam oṟṟa ~um varuṭa ~um 
3.	lakāra ḷakāram āy iraṇṭum piṟakkum. 

 
## 	{SA TE97i} 	{SC TE97n} 	 
1.	itaḻ iyaintu piṟakkum pakāra makāram. 

 
## 	{SA TE98i} 	{SC TE98n} 	 
1.	pal= itaḻ iyaiya vakāram piṟakkum. 

 
## 	{SA TE99i} 	{SC TE99n} 	 
1.	aṇṇam^ cērnta miṭaṟṟu* eḻu vaḷi ~icai 
2.	kaṇṇuṟṟu* aṭaiya yakāram piṟakkum. 

 
## 	{SA TE100i} 	{SC TE100n} 	 
1.	melleḻuttu āṟum piṟappiṉ ākkam^ 
2.	colliya paḷḷi nilaiyiṉa ~āyiṉum* 
3.	mūkkiṉ vaḷiyicai yāppuṟa+ tōṉṟum. 

 
## 	{SA TE101i} 	{SC TE101n} 	 
1.	cārntuvariṉ allatu tamakku* iyalpu* ila ~eṉa+ 
2.	tērntu veḷippaṭutta ~ēṉai mūṉṟu* um^ 
3.	tattam^ cārpiṉ+ piṟappoṭu civaṇi 
