8.	tam= iyal kiḷappiṉ+ ^tam muṉ+ ^tām varūum 
9.	eṇṇiṉ ^tokuti ~uḷappaṭa+ piṟa um 
10.	aṉṉavai ~ellā maruviṉ pāttiya 
11.	puṇariyal* ^nilai ~iṭai ~uṇara+ tōṉṟā. 

 
## 	{SA TE483i} 	{SC TE483n} 	 
1.	kiḷanta ~alla ceyyuḷuḷ+ ṭirina ~um 
2.	vaḻaṅkiyaṉ maruṅkiṉ maruvoṭu tirina ~um 
3.	viḷampiya ~iyaṟkaiyiṉ vēṟupaṭa+ tōṉṟiṉ 
4.	vaḻaṅkiyaṉ maruṅkiṉ uṇarntaṉar oḻukkal* 
5.	^naṉ mati nāṭṭattu eṉmaṉār pulavar. 
